<p>Compiler: I saw already main can handle — but have you delegated to main? Without delegation, how is the main method responsible to handle this? First delegate, then I can compile.</p>
<p>So: even though main has throws, if doMoreStuff and doStuff did not delegate, same CE: unreported exception must be caught or declared to be thrown.</p>
