// remove throws from doMoreStuff   → CE
// all three throws present         → compiles</pre>
<h3>47:30 — Doubt: “In my applications only `main` throws and it works — why not here?”</h3>
<p>In a tiny program there is only one method: `main`. Then throws Exception on main is enough — no other method to walk through.</p>
